# KeyHelp - keybindings HUD (Alt + F1)
#   ✔ Read live from sxhkdrc: add a binding and it shows up here
#   ✔ Sections and descriptions come from the file's comments
#   ✔ Keys rendered as keycaps, instant search, palette themed
#   ✔ Alt + F1 again (or Esc) closes it
#
# Copyright (C) 2021-2026 TechOGR <https://github.com/TechOGR>
